# Video masters. The hero's source is a 23 MB 4K file; only the renditions built
# from it (public/video/hero-*) are served, and they are three orders of
# magnitude smaller. Keep masters here so a deploy never carries one — anything
# under public/ is fetchable by a visitor, and a stray 23 MB in a hero is the
# exact problem the renditions exist to solve. See components/HeroVideo.tsx for
# the ffmpeg commands that regenerate them.
/media

